<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>SCP Article</strong><br />
<strong>Experimentation, Mystery, (Cross-link required)</strong><br />
<strong>Basic article template, followed by a test log section.</strong><br />
<strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>James D. Twist is a deformed humanoid male with anomalous objects melded into his body, who brings tidings of extra-dimensional Armageddon. He suffers from frequent migraines and can see into the soul and/or essence of any target he looks at, alive or inanimate, giving him insight into random facts about the target such as its purpose, drive, desire, function, or method of elimination. What aspects he sees about the target depend on the target itself. His own immediate hume levels are unstable, causing various aspects about himself, such as his strength, speed, durability, wit, linguistic ability, etc. to fluctuate.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Twist, a collector of anomalous artifacts, utilizes his ability in conjunction with the items he collects in order to create a vast array of unexpected effects. In his mission to prepare humanity for the upcoming crisis, Twist seeks to educate the SCP foundation in some of the horrors that he has had to endure and in what he feels must be done to combat the insanity that is making its way to their reality.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Twist, upon being discovered by the SCP foundation, willingly goes with the foundation to answer their questions. Twist allies with the foundation in order to complete his objective in preparing humanity for possibly its greatest confrontation yet. During his crusade, Twist also uses his ability to uncover insight about various people in the foundation in an attempt to manipulate them to gain access to the foundation's other anomalies.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

