<p>Ok, I have edited the post based on your feedback.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I wasn't really sure of what singular part of his name to call him. I suppose I could stick with Twist.</p>
<p>Originally, I thought it best to put down the introduction to his story to build intrigue rather than blatantly put down the entirety of what I plan to do for the article. I had put down a lot more information earlier but that exceeded the word count limit.</p>
<p>The core concept of this character does not lie with hunting down and killing Jack. That's just how Twist ended up being discovered. It's what happens after the SCP foundation gets a hold of Twist that makes up what this article is about. Jack is a part of Twist's mind and is Twist's motivation for escaping the foundation. Take him out of the equation and Twist is very cooperative, answering questions and participating in experiments when allowed. While the SCP foundation's involvement prior to his capture is extremely minimal, the article isn't about the capture so much as it is about the SCP foundation's attempts at containing Twist and learning from him.</p>
<p>The LLUN aura is the source of Twist's anomalous nature and is what gives Twist his various abilities. It is designed to be a mystery for readers to uncover upon reading the article and subsequent experimentation/interview logs.</p>
<p>One of Twist's abilities is his ability to look at something and instantly obtain information about that something's purpose, function, how it works, and how to eliminate it. The LLUN aura prevents Twist from divulging information about anything that might reveal information about the LLUN. It is the main antagonizing force within this article as the SCP foundation struggles to get as much information out of Twist as possible, seeing as Twist can contain secret knowledge about ANY SCP creature that he comes into contact with.</p>
</div>
