<p>The purpose of the greenlighting process is to convince at least two authors that you can communicate your idea in a compelling manner.</p>
<p>So&#8230; I am not concerned that you would not explain the aura in the idea post, I am concerned that it seems to have no connection to the anomalies as presented. I feel like you missed the point of my critique.</p>
