<p><em>When I said this ^ it was not to suggest anything but that your idea felt too disjointed and you should simplify the core anomaly to make more cohesive sense.</em></p>
<p>You need to develop a cohesive proposal for the idea to communicate what your story is about.</p>
<p>No one is going to greenlight your concept without you explaining the concept. If you choose to withold and say something like &quot;you'll learn about it in the article&quot; I wouldn't trust that this will turn into an article that could survive.</p>

